<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Our Story | Feels Like Om</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/type-system.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/">Feels Like Om</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary class="active">ABOUT</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/about/our-story" aria-current="page">Our story</a>
            <a href="/about/getting-to-sikkim">Getting to Sikkim</a>
            <a href="/about/visa-and-permits">Visa and permits</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <details class="nav-dropdown">
          <summary>JOURNEYS</summary>
          <div class="submenu">
            <a href="/journeys/the-flagship">The Flagship</a>
            <a href="/journeys/how-to-embrace-suffering">To Be Free</a>
            <a href="/journeys#feels-like-home">Feels Like Home</a>
            <a href="/journeys#way-of-the-yaks">Way of the Yaks</a>
          </div>
        </details>
        <a href="/reflections">REFLECTIONS</a>
        <a href="/contact">CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="story-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">OUR STORY</p>
        <h1>The people behind Feels Like Om</h1>
      </section>

      <section class="founder-story" id="zi-hui">
        <div class="portrait-column">
          <div class="portrait-wrap">
            <img src="/zi-hui.JPG" alt="Zi Hui walking through a village in Sikkim" />
          </div>
          <p class="founder-name">Zi Hui</p>
        </div>

        <article>
          <blockquote>“A tree helped me forgive myself.”</blockquote>

          <div class="body-copy">
            <p>The name <em>Feels Like Om</em> is inspired by the feeling of home that Sikkim extends to all who come and how spiritual the land inspires one to be.</p>

            <p>I went to Sikkim for the first time because of a Service-Learning project, but it turned out to be an unintentional discovery of who I am and what matters to me. The land and the Sikkimese people gifted me a new pair of lens to see the world with.</p>

            <p>Today, we are going through unprecedented times. With the relentless pursuit of capitalist growth and unchecked consumerism, our planet suffers and we suffer too. We are becoming lonelier as a species because we forgot how to connect with one another.</p>

            <p>I serve you as a bridge between you and the indigenous communities, so that you may learn from them and reconnect with yourself.</p>

            <aside class="question" aria-label="Reflection question">
              <p>How might we co-create an interdependently thriving world?</p>
            </aside>

            <section class="favourite-books" aria-labelledby="favourite-books-title">
              <h2 id="favourite-books-title">Favourite books</h2>
              <p>
                <a href="https://www.normawong.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">When No Thing Works — Norma Wong</a>
              </p>
            </section>
          </div>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #f4efe5;
    color: #18301f;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .site-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 4%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24, 48, 31, 0.15);
  }

  .brand {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .main-nav {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .main-nav > a,
  summary {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .main-nav .active { border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor; }
  .nav-dropdown { position: relative; }
  summary { list-style: none; }
  summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

  .submenu {
    position: absolute;
    top: calc(100% + .65rem);
    right: 0;
    width: max-content;
    min-width: 13rem;
    padding: 0.7rem;
    background: #fffaf1;
    border-radius: 0.4rem;
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(8, 20, 12, 0.13);
    z-index: 5;
    opacity: 0;
    visibility: hidden;
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    transition: opacity 160ms ease, visibility 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .submenu::before { content: ""; position: absolute; top: -.75rem; left: 0; right: 0; height: .75rem; }

  @media (hover:hover) {
    .nav-dropdown:hover .submenu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }
    .nav-dropdown:not(:hover) .submenu { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; transform: translateY(-4px); }
  }

  .submenu a {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.75rem;
    color: #18301f;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  .submenu a:hover { background: rgba(24,48,31,.06); }

  .story-intro {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 8%));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 9rem) 0 clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .story-intro h1 {
    width: min(100%, 42rem);
    margin: 1.1rem auto 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 4rem) !important;
    line-height: 1.15;
    white-space: normal;
  }

  .founder-story {
    width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 8%));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.85fr) minmax(0, 1.15fr);
    gap: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .founder-story article {
    min-width: 0;
    width: 100%;
    padding-right: clamp(.5rem, 1.5vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .portrait-column {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }

  .portrait-wrap {
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 0.25rem;
    aspect-ratio: 2 / 3;
    background: #d8d1c3;
  }

  .portrait-wrap img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 50% 42%;
  }

  .founder-name {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    line-height: 1;
    text-align: center;
  }

  blockquote {
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 0 3rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 2.6vw, 2.7rem) !important;
    line-height: 1.18;
    white-space: normal;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .body-copy {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    font-size: clamp(.95rem, 1.05vw, 1.05rem);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .body-copy > p {
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .question {
    margin: 3rem 0;
    padding: 1.35rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(255, 250, 241, 0.72);
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 48, 31, 0.16);
    border-radius: 0.35rem;
  }

  .question p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .favourite-books {
    margin-top: clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    padding-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(24, 48, 31, 0.16);
  }

  .favourite-books h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.8vw, 3rem) !important;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .favourite-books p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .favourite-books a {
    color: inherit;
    text-underline-offset: .3rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
    }

    .main-nav {
      gap: 0.75rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .submenu { right: auto; left: 0; }
    .nav-dropdown[open] .submenu { opacity: 1; visibility: visible; transform: translateY(0); }

    .story-intro,
    .founder-story {
      width: calc(100% - 2.5rem);
    }

    .story-intro { padding-top: 4rem; }

    .story-intro h1,
    blockquote {
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .founder-story {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 5rem;
    }

    .founder-story article {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .portrait-column {
      position: static;
    }

    .portrait-wrap {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    }
  }
</style>
